    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a permanent stain now. i used to be their pride, and now i'll just be the mistake they always have to think about. wouldn't it be easier for everyone if the version of me they loved was the only thing that stayed? like, if this failure wasn't the last thing they ever knew about me.",
